Important Issue With Your Code

You have:

size1(head)

inside every recursive call.

For example:

1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6 → ...

You calculate the remaining list size repeatedly:

size(n)
size(n-k)
size(n-2k)
...

So you are traversing many nodes more than once.

The solution is still correct, but the repeated size calculation makes it less clean and can lead to O(n²) total traversal in the worst case.

Approach 5 — Iterative Pointer Manipulation ⭐ Most Optimal

We can solve everything by directly manipulating links.

This is the best interview solution because:

Time  = O(n)
Space = O(1)

